  "description": "QUMFIP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H80 N4 Nd4 O20,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.815-4.050 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.98-111.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd4(μ3-OH)2(salen)2(acac)6(CH3OH)2]·CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
